{"data": [{"author_id": "1305905708018348032", "created_at": "2026-10-27T13:06:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115067519711039584"], "id": "2115067519711039584", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 798, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2025年中国大陆出生人口降至792万，广东占全国约八分之一\n\n中国大陆最新人口统计数据显示，2025年全国出生人口为792万人，比2024年减少162万人，降幅约17%。广东仍是全国出生人口最多的省份，东北地区则面临最严重的人口自然减少。 https://t.co/De6GKPOXvx", "url": "https://x.com/CausMoney/status/2115067519711039584"}, {"author_id": "1972207865982337025", "created_at": "2026-10-26T09:00:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114643302612152622"], "id": "2114643302612152622", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 56, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "全国人口这样下去早晚都跌破14亿，据统计25年末中国人口14.0489亿，出生人口只有792万人，既然广东出生人口和结婚人口最多，东北出生人口结婚人口最少，东北人啥情况，都不结婚生小孩?国家得出手了，我之前就建议国家每个家庭每出生一个小孩，奖励3000股中国工商银行股票，持有到18岁，再给他，留给他", "url": "https://x.com/haora43401/status/2114643302612152622"}, {"author_id": "1589682940170018816", "created_at": "2026-10-26T03:17:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114556968199430195"], "id": "2114556968199430195", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 114, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "有人说\n\n按照现在每年的出生人口来看，未来将是伊斯兰教的天下？\n\n对吗？@grok", "url": "https://x.com/Tonyrmjr/status/2114556968199430195"}, {"author_id": "1857394183839072256", "created_at": "2026-10-26T00:55:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114521173023510545"], "id": "2114521173023510545", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2025年全年，全国出生人口达792万人\n\n出生率为5.63%o，自然增长率为-2.41%o。\n\n我4个孩子，贡献不少", "url": "https://x.com/x_deeplink/status/2114521173023510545"}, {"author_id": "1226860918551613451", "created_at": "2026-10-26T02:36:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114546569550889031"], "id": "2114546569550889031", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 36, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "股市崩了，就业率崩了，出生人口也崩了，我的心要碎了！💔\n每天持续下跌真的很无助，仿佛是超速的车轮冲向悬崖的绝望……", "url": "https://x.com/zeromikiy/status/2114546569550889031"}, {"author_id": "1708386139659489280", "created_at": "2026-10-26T04:01:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114566620081524983", "2114568058392224096", "2114568110670049327"], "id": "2114568110670049327", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "一个冷知识\n\n广东一年出生100.3万人\n\n相当于全国每8个新生儿里，就有1个出生在广东\n\n全球出生人口走低的当下，广东人还是太能生了", "url": "https://x.com/overTMoonn/status/2114568110670049327"}, {"author_id": "1708386139659489280", "created_at": "2026-10-26T04:01:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114566620081524983", "2114568058392224096", "2114568110670049327"], "id": "2114568058392224096", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "一个冷知识\n\n广东一年出生100.3万人\n\n相当于全锅每8个新生儿里，就有1个出生在广东\n\n全球出生人口走低的当下，广东人还是太能生了", "url": "https://x.com/overTMoonn/status/2114568058392224096"}, {"author_id": "1846031631905353728", "created_at": "2026-10-27T01:32:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114893064288473345"], "id": "2114893064288473345", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 412, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "我想了三天三夜也没想明白\n\n2025出生人口曝光马上要跌破14亿人口了！\n\n为什么现在人都不愿意生孩子了？？\n\n😱😱😱😱", "url": "https://x.com/qingdao114515/status/2114893064288473345"}, {"author_id": "1708386139659489280", "created_at": "2026-10-26T03:55:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114566620081524983", "2114568058392224096", "2114568110670049327"], "id": "2114566620081524983", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "一个冷知识\n\n广东一年出生100.3万人\n\n相当于全世界每8个新生儿里，就有1个出生在广东\n\n全球出生人口走低的当下，广东人还是太能生了", "url": "https://x.com/overTMoonn/status/2114566620081524983"}, {"author_id": "1921437096688173056", "created_at": "2026-10-26T17:26:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114770532834885804"], "id": "2114770532834885804", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1371, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2025 年，中国人口又减少了 339 万，总人口只剩 14.05 亿，眼看就要跌破 14 亿了\n\n全年出生人口只有 792 万，自然增长率降到-2.41‰\n\n折腾了几十年，计划生育终于超额完成任务了", "url": "https://x.com/4gU8m/status/2114770532834885804"}, {"author_id": "1913553866072956928", "created_at": "2026-10-27T10:46:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115032261640982767"], "id": "2115032261640982767", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "我作为一个中国人，我觉得中国没有未来，不尊重劳动法，工作环境恶劣，社保两元制，出生人口一年比一年低，35岁以上找不到工作，", "url": "https://x.com/cqw1990/status/2115032261640982767"}, {"author_id": "1834986164258062336", "created_at": "2026-10-27T15:28:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115103322537685104"], "id": "2115103322537685104", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 217, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "卧槽！\n\n广东已经连续8年出生人口第一\n\n全国每8个小孩就有一个广东人\n\n广东为何对生孩子这么执着？\n\n是不是没有男孩就会一直生？", "url": "https://x.com/ransi257/status/2115103322537685104"}, {"author_id": "1952737630661357568", "created_at": "2026-10-26T07:15:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114616911569002767"], "id": "2114616911569002767", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 98, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "中国人口都快跌破14亿了。\n\n一年少339万人，出生人口只有792万。\n\n以前担心人太多，现在开始担心没人生了。\n\n兄弟们，你们身边这两年结婚生孩子的人，是变多了还是变少了？", "url": "https://x.com/Tai9492Hui/status/2114616911569002767"}, {"author_id": "1378164402101182469", "created_at": "2026-10-26T01:43:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114533288350216394"], "id": "2114533288350216394", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2987, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "中国总人口面临跌破14亿！\n\n2025年全国出生人口792万，1949年以来头一回跌破800万。\n\n拉时间轴更直观。上世纪80年代，2000万上下。2016年放开二孩，1786万。2024年，954万。2025年，792万。\n\n十年，腰斩。\n\n年末总人口140489万，比上一年又少339万。离14亿这条线，只剩489万的缓冲。 https://t.co/CFfKSqZwzf", "url": "https://x.com/Appraiser008/status/2114533288350216394"}, {"author_id": "2077746506640367616", "created_at": "2026-10-27T15:12:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115099217111007464"], "id": "2115099217111007464", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "我有个35岁的朋友，家里老人天天催他生二胎他说，2025年的数据出来了，出生人口男孩比女孩多催生的先看看这个数据再催你们家催二胎的，先把这个数据贴墙上", "url": "https://x.com/jinanni2017/status/2115099217111007464"}, {"author_id": "2031656947750223872", "created_at": "2026-10-27T07:05:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114976662895120603"], "id": "2114976662895120603", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "人社部数据：截至今年9月底，全国基本养老保险参保人数10.79亿。\n国家统计局数据：2025年末，全国60岁以上老人3.23亿，占总人口23%，差不多每四个中国人里，就有一个过了60岁。", "url": "https://x.com/ChrickyLi/status/2114976662895120603"}, {"author_id": "1225831585947107329", "created_at": "2026-10-25T22:56:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114491273977434167"], "id": "2114491273977434167", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 183, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "《中国统计年鉴2026》：2025年末全国人口14.05亿，一年少了339万。出生人口792万，自然增长率-2.41‰，东北三省出生率垫底（黑龙江2.65‰）。鼓励生育喊了这么多年，为什么越来越没人愿意生？来源：微博 @荔枝新闻 #中国人口 #人口危机 https://t.co/yO73Sq017v", "url": "https://x.com/Lin92922154/status/2114491273977434167"}, {"author_id": "1646490005131640832", "created_at": "2026-10-26T02:25:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114543829395390922"], "id": "2114543829395390922", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 28, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "中国平均一户人家只剩2.52人了，2000年还是3.44人。\n\n今天上了微博热搜：户均最少的是黑龙江2.17人、北京2.23人，最多的是海南3.2人。去年全国出生人口792万。\n\n三代同堂越来越少，两三口人成了常态。你身边一般一家几口？ https://t.co/1bNf1kctvQ", "url": "https://x.com/cojimng1453815/status/2114543829395390922"}, {"author_id": "1788497048582455296", "created_at": "2026-10-27T12:17:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115055190328176760"], "id": "2115055190328176760", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 273, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115054045509689819", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "哪个人说的，发出来，给你指标性数据你又说我抹黑，给你说权利和义务，你又觉得中国民众不应该拥有基本人权，再给你说个数据，中国出生人口腰斩速度世界最快，笑话人菲律宾干嘛，自己大把人断子绝孙 https://t.co/T6WfUOSZQW", "url": "https://x.com/xijinping_pong/status/2115055190328176760"}, {"author_id": "1306129238827778048", "created_at": "2026-10-26T08:42:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114638668812197936"], "id": "2114638668812197936", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 609, "like_count": 12, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "全国总人口面临跌破14亿\n\n2025年末全国总人口数据正式出炉，总量为140489万人，对比2024年末的140828万人，全年总人口净减少339万人。\n\n2025年全年，全国出生人口达到792万人，对应人口出生率为5.63‰，全国人口自然增长率为-2.41‰，人口总量继续保持温和下行的态势。\n\n来源：新浪财经", "url": "https://x.com/YukinonCC/status/2114638668812197936"}, {"author_id": "1853839513958961152", "created_at": "2026-10-27T08:57:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115005013202456682"], "id": "2115005013202456682", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 171, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "把 2016 年到 2025 年十年间的央视新闻出生人口播报画面拼在同一张图里，数字从 1883 万一路滑落到 792 万。\n\n十张标准的新闻演播室截图排在一起，不需要任何多余的煽情文字，这条陡峭向下的曲线就已经道尽了时代的变化。\n\n身边生娃的人变少了吗？ https://t.co/wAykEcyMDj", "url": "https://x.com/baiwan_8878/status/2115005013202456682"}, {"author_id": "861791313037066240", "created_at": "2026-10-27T01:24:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114890995259375631"], "id": "2114890995259375631", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 200, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "日本2026年6月3日公布数据，新生儿67.12万人，生育率1.14，东京只有0.96，现场没有倒吸凉气，只有纸页翻动。\n\n镜头转回中国，2025年出生人口792万，首次跌破800万，人口自然增长率为负2.41‰，网上最常见的反应不是震动，而是“意料之中”。这四个字，比792万更沉。\n\n问题来了，我们到底失去了什么？", "url": "https://x.com/henan0371/status/2114890995259375631"}, {"author_id": "781055299838849024", "created_at": "2026-10-27T13:46:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115077555866968311"], "id": "2115077555866968311", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "难不成还会继续跌 (盘面与人口)\n\n① 出生人口数据出来,很多人先想到社保和养老金。换个角度:长期的人口背景,会倒逼我们在资产配置上打开思路。不是急着动手,是先放进观察清单。\n\n② 作者的习惯:看不清的时候,不急于下结论,先观察。\"我不会直接定义它是诱多还是别的。\"", "url": "https://x.com/Filliszhanglx/status/2115077555866968311"}, {"author_id": "198124278", "created_at": "2026-10-26T10:02:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114658846077751474"], "id": "2114658846077751474", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 547, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "微博两个热搜一起看 #老干妈AI质检引发争议# #全国总人口面临跌破14亿# \n\n新出生人口越来越少，未来的消费者也越来越少，市场增长越来越难。\n\n企业为了生存，只能拼命降本增效。\n\n但流量又被平台攥在手里，获客成本越来越高，降得本，还不够交给平台。\n\n平台拿着这些钱，投入算力、算法和 AI。\n\nAI https://t.co/ouS4Nma3ca", "url": "https://x.com/xiaoteshushu/status/2114658846077751474"}, {"author_id": "1691439809028632576", "created_at": "2026-10-26T14:31:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114726611727654933"], "id": "2114726611727654933", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 179, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2056010477449388526", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "#生育率中G经济慢变量 10.23国常会提出“加快建设生育友好型社会”——努力稳定新出生人口规模。最新数据“老人比小孩0-14岁多1089万”：2025年老年抚养比为23.1%少儿抚养比为22%。“老人比小孩多”会在5-6年里加速呈现——意味着住房学校乃至医院及城市配套设施都会全面过剩：生育率经济的慢变量变成核心变量。 https://t.co/CAKMQdznlm https://t.co/GPSZjZ7cls", "url": "https://x.com/mikeyequzi/status/2114726611727654933"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "1305905708018348032", "name": "加美财经caus.com", "username": "CausMoney"}, {"id": "1972207865982337025", "name": "Bob", "username": "haora43401"}, {"id": "1589682940170018816", "name": "Tony", "username": "Tonyrmjr"}, {"id": "1857394183839072256", "name": "带着菜刀的诗人", "username": "x_deeplink"}, {"id": "1226860918551613451", "name": "ZeroMikiy", "username": "zeromikiy"}, {"id": "1708386139659489280", "name": "我的token呢", "username": "overTMoonn"}, {"id": "1846031631905353728", "name": "Xorist", "username": "qingdao114515"}, {"id": "1921437096688173056", "name": "陆晨", "username": "4gU8m"}, {"id": "1913553866072956928", "name": "cqw12345", "username": "cqw1990"}, {"id": "1834986164258062336", "name": "ransi燃思", "username": "ransi257"}, {"id": "1952737630661357568", "name": "alex", "username": "Tai9492Hui"}, {"id": "1378164402101182469", "name": "🇨🇳 大牛🇨🇳", "username": "Appraiser008"}, {"id": "2077746506640367616", "name": "Annie", "username": "jinanni2017"}, {"id": "2031656947750223872", "name": "chricky", "username": "ChrickyLi"}, {"id": "1225831585947107329", "name": "梅大师飞越美中", "username": "Lin92922154"}, {"id": "1646490005131640832", "name": "明仔（诚信互关版）", "username": "cojimng1453815"}, {"id": "1788497048582455296", "name": "李克强", "username": "xijinping_pong"}, {"id": "1306129238827778048", "name": "ユキ🎀", "username": "YukinonCC"}, {"id": "1853839513958961152", "name": "佰萬", "username": "baiwan_8878"}, {"id": "861791313037066240", "name": "未来 ( 有关必回 ，没有回就是在冷却中)", "username": "henan0371"